	"descriptionMarkdown": "Defensive perimeter composed of electric turrets. The electric grid does not incur any drain from the turrets while inactive. \nWhen activated via a proximal enemy, the center detector turret rapidly drains the accumulator. Circuits detect a sharp change in accumulator charge level and closes power switches to connect the main grid to all laser turrets. A check mark constant combinator is used to permanently connect the electric grid to the electric turrets if the detector turret, big electric pole, or combinator are destroyed. If the solar panel or accumulator are destroyed, the power switches will also detect a lack of accumulator charge and permanently close the power switches.\n\nThe Dragon Teeth wall design is copied from Knooper's design #5 on this YouTube video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hM2YThrpq0U\nMemory cell is based on this design: https://factorioprints.com/view/-OAdA5QNnn6vVHQKP06g\n\nThis perimeter wall does not connect to corners well. A separate blueprint is available for the corners.\n\nBe careful when chaining these wall segments together; the wires between power poles will often link grid sections when they should not be linked.",
